  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed two storey side to rear extension, by reason of its design, excessive combined bulk and massing, would form an incongruous, discordant, unduly bulky and dominant addition to the host dwelling which would fail to respect the prevailing character of the locality, contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3.D(1) and D3.D(11) of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed extensions by reason of their scale and positioning in close proximity to neighbouring boundaries with Nos 8 and 10 Heather Way would be unduly obtrusive and overbearing. The proposed would result in loss of light, privacy and undue sense of enclosure and would be detrimental to the residential amenities of the occupiers of the adjoining properties contrary to Policy D3.D (1) and (11) of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
